Cool — so when you said “make it a codex”, you probably meant turning your wrestling game rules and content into a codex format — like a book/manual that contains all the fighter stats, rules, moves, finishers, and gameplay mechanics in one organized reference you can use to play the game.  ￼

A codex literally refers to a book or manuscript — originally handwritten pages bound together — and is often used to organize detailed rules and information in games and tabletop systems.  ￼

So let’s do that — I’ll turn your lucha libre AAA x WWE 2K25 game rules into a real codex you can play from!

⸻

🛡️ Lucha Libre AAA x WWE 2K25 — MATCH CODEX

