🎮 3. How to Play
	1.	Players & Turns:
	•	Up to 3 players take turns in order: Player 1 → Player 2 → Player 3.
	•	Each turn you pick one action for your wrestler.
	2.	Actions per Turn:
	•	Normal Attack — Use one basic move
	•	Special Move — Use a more powerful attack
	•	Finisher — Only if opponent is below 30% health
	•	Defend — Reduce incoming damage next turn
	3.	Resolving Combat:
	•	When attacking, roll a 1–6 die:
	•	1–2: Miss
	•	3–4: Normal damage
	•	5–6: Critical hit (double damage)
	4.	Health Tracking:
	•	Each wrestler starts with their max health.
	•	Reduce health when hit.
	•	If health ≤ 0, wrestler is down.

⸻

🪩 4. Match Rules

📍 Triple Threat Rules:
	•	No disqualifications
	•	Fast-paced
	•	Win by pinfall or submission

🎯 Winning:
	•	To win, you must be the last wrestler standing after both opponents are downed or you pin one while the other is out.

📜 Finisher Rules:
	•	You can only use your finisher move when an opponent has ≤ 30% of their health remaining.

⸻

🧠 5. Turn Example

👉 Player 1: Psycho Clown uses Chaos Strike and rolls a 5 → Critical Hit!
👉 Player 2: Vikingo dodges with speed → small damage
👉 Player 3: Pentagon Jr. hits with Kick Combo…

Then continue rounds until someone wins!

⸻

🏁 6. Notes
	•	Feel free to add your own wrestlers
	•	You can expand with tag teams and arenas
	•	This codex works like a tabletop wrestling game

